{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q2083871","formula":"C₁₈H₂₅NO₅","hill":"C18H25NO5","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":18.0,"H":25.0,"N":1.0,"O":5.0},"names":{"en":"Senecionine","ru":"Сенеционин"},"descriptions":{"en":"Senecionine is a toxic pyrrolizidine alkaloid isolated from various botanical sources. It takes its name from the Senecio genus and is produced by many different plants in that genus, including Jacobaea vulgaris (Senecio jacobaea). It has also been isolated from several other plants, including Brachyglottis repanda, Emilia, Erechtites hieraciifolius, Petasites, Syneilesis, Crotalaria, Caltha leptosepala, and Castilleja.","ru":"Сенеционин — пирролизидиновый алкалоид, выделенный из многих видов растений рода крестовник (Senecio). В 1895 году он был открыт Гранвалем и Лажу в крестовнике обыкновенном (Senecio vulgaris). В 1949 году сенеционин был выделен Р. А. Коноваловой из кавказского вида Senecio condollianus[уточнить] и Адамсом из Senecio cineraria."},"fame":13,"pubchemCid":5280906,"mass":335.4,"charge":0,"smiles":"C/C=C\\1/C[C@H]([C@@](C(=O)OCC2=CCN3[C@H]2[C@@H](CC3)OC1=O)(C)O)C","inchikey":"HKODIGSRFALUTA-JTLQZVBZSA-N","iupac":"(1R,4Z,6R,7R,17R)-4-ethylidene-7-hydroxy-6,7-dimethyl-2,9-dioxa-14-azatricyclo[9.5.1.014,17]heptadec-11-ene-3,8-dione","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"5280906","atoms":49,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-0.854,"y":0.971,"z":-0.274,"el":"O"},{"x":0.355,"y":-1.855,"z":-0.866,"el":"O"},{"x":3.406,"y":-1.679,"z":1.015,"el":"O"},{"x":-0.233,"y":2.812,"z":-1.527,"el":"O"},{"x":1.028,"y":-2.875,"z":1.091,"el":"O"},{"x":-3.738,"y":-0.19,"z":0.327,"el":"N"},{"x":-2.71,"y":-0.575,"z":-0.688,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.015,"y":0.734,"z":-1.093,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.094,"y":1.771,"z":-0.791,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.676,"y":1.262,"z"